  "problem": "Suppose that\n\n$$\nS={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{{(-1)}^{n}}{{e}^{n+2}}\n$$\n\nand that ${s}_{6}$ is the sixth partial sum of $S.$ According to the alternating series error bound, $|S-{s}_{6}|<k$ for some real number $k.$\n\nFind the value of $k.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$k=$\n\n{{field-1}}",
